From 3b6619ea8444802e8e9590a5049dee7a0a852a20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:56:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Transmitter networks for WASM block entities (API block 9)

transmitter-spec (cables and pipes of a medium: energy or a tank kind),
networks of touching transmitters with the least throughput, even sharing
between machines, connecting faces a mod can change; pure logic in
horizon_mods::network (7 tests); the game runs it before the neighbour
transfers; cable-demo example.
